        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Ryan's got it, but let me break it down a bit further.  When an incapacitated Hero allows another Hero to use a power, that Hero doesn't get to use an additional power on their own turn; rather, they use the power immediately, on the incapacitated Hero's turn.  Thus, they could use the same power multiple times in the same [b]round[/b], but not in the same [b]turn[/b].\n\nThanks for your question!  I hope this helps.",
